    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm running into an issue with our sublimation heat press. the ink transfer is looking really inconsistent on the polyester blends. sometimes the colors look bright, but other times they look washed out or even patchy. what should i be checking regarding the temp and pressure settings to fix this?",
